+### Deploy on Wasmer
+
+[![Deploy to Wasmer](https://img.shields.io/badge/Deploy%20to-Wasmer-171717?logo=wasmer&logoColor=white)](https://wasmer.io/apps/create?github=treefarmstudio%2Fodyssey-theme)
+
+Wasmer detects the Astro project, runs `npm install` and `npm run build`, and serves the generated `dist` folder as a static site (the contact and newsletter forms still need a form backend such as Formspree or Formspark). The button opens Wasmer's import page for this public repository, where you review the configuration and click Deploy; it does not create a copy of the repository in your GitHub account. To build your own site, fork this repository and import your fork on Wasmer.
